              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dan+Freed"} D.S. Freed
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Kazhdan"} D. Kazhdan
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"} E. Witten
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Quantum+Fields+and+Strings"}> Quantum Fields and Strings
                  , A course for mathematicians
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.ias.edu/qft"} web version
          %p
            The original article that introduced the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%27Auria-Fre+formulation+of+supergravity"} D'Auria-Fre formulation of supergravity
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riccardo+D%27Auria"}> Riccardo D'Auria
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"} Pietro Fré
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/GeometricSupergravity.pdf", :title => "Geometric Supergravity in D=11 and its hidden supergroup"} Geometric Supergravity in D=11 and its hidden supergroup
          %p
            The underlying
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+Cartan+geometry"} super Cartan geometry
            is made fully explicit in:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Konstantin+Eder"}> Konstantin Eder
              ,
              %em Super Cartan geometry and the super Ashtekar connection
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.09630"}> arXiv:2010.09630
              )
          %p
            A compendium, of relevant
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action+functionals"} action functionals
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equations+of+motion"} equations of motion
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              M. J. D. Hamilton,
              %em The field and Killing spinor equations of M-theory and type IIA/IIB supergravity in coordinate-free notation
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1607.00327"}> arXiv:1607.00327
              )
          %p
            On
            = succeed "-solutions:" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+hole"} black hole
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riccardo+D%27Auria"}> Riccardo D'Auria
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fre"} Pietro Fre
                = succeed "," do
                  %em BPS black holes in supergravity
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9812160"} hep-th/9812160
            %li
              %p
                Antonio Gallerati,
                %em Constructing black hole solutions in supergravity theories
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1905.04104"}> arXiv:1905.04104
                )
          %p
            On
            = succeed "-techniques:" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pure+spinor"} pure spinor
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Martin+Cederwall"}> Martin Cederwall
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Pure spinors in classical and quantum supergravity
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Handbook+of+Quantum+Gravity"} Handbook of Quantum Gravity
              (2023) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.06141"}> arXiv:2210.06141
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+curvature+corrections"} higher curvature corrections
          %ul
            %li
              Mehmet Ozkan, Yi Pang,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ergin+Sezgin"} Ergin Sezgin
              %em Higher Derivative Supergravities in Diverse Dimensions
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.08945"}> arXiv:2401.08945
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            An
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/S-matrix"} S-matrix
            perspective:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Brando Bellazzini, Alex Pomarol, Marcello Romano, Francesco Sciotti:
