                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.04408"}> arXiv:2509.04408
                ]
              %blockquote
                %p (generalization to non-abelian Read-Rezayi states)
          %h3#History History
          %p The idea of supergravity was proposed by
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitry+Volkov"}> Dmitry Volkov
              , V.P. Akulov,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Possible universal neutrino interaction
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.jetpletters.ac.ru/ps/1766/article_26864.shtml"} pdf
          %p followed up by the first model of supergravity (in nonlinear realization) constructed in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitry+Volkov"}> Dmitry Volkov
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vyacheslav+Soroka"} Vyacheslav Soroka
              = succeed "," do
                %em Higgs effect for Goldstone particles with spin 1/2
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.jetpletters.ac.ru/ps/1568/article_24038.shtml"} pdf
          %p
            However, the term “supergravity” was coined later by
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#FreedmanNieuwenhuizenFerrara76"} Freedman, Nieuwenhuizen, Ferrara 76
          %p This early history is discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steven+Duplij"}> Steven Duplij
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supergravity was discovered by D.V. Volkov and V.A. Soroka in 1973, wasn’t it?
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.03259"} arXiv:1910.03259
            %li#Kuzenko21
              %p
                Sergei M. Kuzenko,
                %em Local supersymmetry: Variations on a theme by Volkov and Soroka
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.12835"}> arXiv:2110.12835
                )
          %p
            Supergravity, in the guise of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/4d+supergravity"} 4d supergravity
          %ul
            %li#FreedmanNieuwenhuizenFerrara76
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Freedman"}> Daniel Freedman
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+van+Nieuwenhuizen"} Peter van Nieuwenhuizen
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergio+Ferrara"} Sergio Ferrara
              = succeed "," do
                %em Progress toward a theory of supergravity
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.13.3214"} doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.13.3214
          %p Accounts of the early history of supergravity::
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergio+Ferrara"}> Sergio Ferrara
                ,
                %em Supergravity and the quest for a unified theory
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9405065"}> arxiv:hep-th/9405065
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitry+Volkov"}> Dmitry Volkov
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supergravity before 1976
              %p
                International Conference on the History of Original Ideas and Basic Discoveries in Particle Physics, Erice, 1994 (
                %a{:href => "http://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-1-4613-1147-8_34"} Springer, Chapter
                or
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9410024"} arXiv:hep-th/9410024
            %li
              %p
                R. Arnowitt,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ali+Chamseddine"} Ali Chamseddine
                %em The Development of Supergravity Grand Unification: Circa 1982-85
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1206.3175"}> arXiv:1206.3175
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitry+Volkov"}> Dmitry Volkov
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supergravity before and after 1976. The story of goldstonions
              %p
                S. Duplij, J. Bagger, W. Siegel (Eds.), Springer, 2004](http://www.springer.com/gp/book/9781402013386) or
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9404153"} arXiv:hep-th/9404153
            %li
              %p
                David Appell,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em When supergravity was born
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.davidappell.com/articles/PWSep12appell-supergravity.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+van+Nieuwenhuizen"}> Peter van Nieuwenhuizen
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Aspects of supergravity
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://media.scgp.stonybrook.edu/presentations/20140109_vanNieuwenhuizen.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vyacheslav+Soroka"}> Vyacheslav Soroka
                ,
                %em The Sources of Supergravity
                in
                %a{:href => "http://www.worldscientific.com/doi/10.1142/9789812385505_0011"} The Supersymmetric World. The Beginnings of the Theory, G. Kane and M. Shifman (Eds.), World Scientific, 2000
                or
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0203171"} arXiv:hep-th/0203171
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergio+Ferrara"}> Sergio Ferrara
                , A. Sagnotti,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supergravity at 40: Reflections and Perspectives
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Schwarz"} John Schwarz
                on the occasion of his 75-th birthday (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1702.00743"}> arXiv:1702.00743
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stanley+Deser"}> Stanley Deser
                ,
                %em A brief history of Supergravity: the first three weeks
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1704.05886"}> arXiv:1704.05886
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bernard+L.+Julia"}> Bernard L. Julia
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em An exceptional story: Symmetries and dualities between Maximal supergravity and General relativity
                %em Half a Century of Supergravity
