            of supergravity coupled to the (non-supersymmetric)
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/standard+model+of+particle+physics"} standard model of particle physics
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cliff+P.+Burgess"}> Cliff P. Burgess
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fernando+Quevedo"} Fernando Quevedo
              = succeed "," do
                %em Who’s Afraid of the Supersymmetric Dark? The Standard Model vs Low-Energy Supergravity
              %strong 70
              7-8 (2022) 2200077 &amp;lbrack;
